# The plugin's OAuth client identity document (CIMD). The hosted sign-in server fetches it
# over https, checks its client_id is this URL, and keeps it for max-age (1 hour; it caps at
# 24). Changing this file changes who the plugin is to the server: it is generated from the
# plugin's client_identity.py, never edited by hand.
/oauth/memorysafe-plugin.json
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
